  "solution": {
    "text": "Anions are more nucleophilic than neutral. So,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> is least nucleophilic.<br />nucleophilicity<math><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> density<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2b4eea1a-3e78-44ad-b5f3-c35b8df41f6b-image.png\" style=\"width: 498px; height: 217px;\" /><br /><br />Greater the delocalization of charge, lesser will be nucleophilicity.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>",
